              "Annexe"
            ],
            "content": "<p><br/>ANNEXE</p><p><div align=\"center\"><center><table border=\"1\"><tr><th><br/>ATTRIBUTAIRES</th><th><br/>TAUX DE RETENUE \n      <br/>\n    POUR RISQUE DE NON-RECOUVREMENT</th></tr><tr><td align=\"justify\"><br/>FEDERATION AGIRC-ARRCO</td><td valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><br/>1,7%</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" align=\"justify\"><br/>IRCANTEC</td><td valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\"><br/>0,3%</td></tr></table></center></div></p>",
